Subject: [PATCH] fix(skills): remove provider-specific attribution

---
 .agents/skills/ship/SKILL.md              |  2 -
 skills/ship/SKILL.md                      |  2 -
 test/agents-skills-repo-discovery.test.js | 52 +++++++++++++++++++++++
 3 files changed, 52 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/.agents/skills/ship/SKILL.md b/.agents/skills/ship/SKILL.md
index 2352a19b..28464ca5 100644
--- a/.agents/skills/ship/SKILL.md
+++ b/.agents/skills/ship/SKILL.md
@@ -148,8 +148,6 @@ If no PR template exists, use this minimal fallback:
 
 ## Issue
 Closes forge-xxx
